  "pdf_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf",
  "pdf_sha256": "020c8ce42595fcca7c41ebf3960599287aa83cffeb6dfb846cc0156a2b8793ef",
  "rights": "原刊本文及逐欄自讀錄字。數位原圖留於館藏與 Commons 外鏈。",
  "range": "第13面，卷十一第十葉下至十一葉上，全18欄。",
  "columns": [
    {
      "locator": "13R01",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 1,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18,
      "text": "殷淑儀南郡王義宣女也麗色巧笑義宣敗後"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R02",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 2,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 18,
      "end": 36,
      "text": "帝密取之寵冠後宮假姓殷氏左右宣泄者多"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R03",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 36,
      "end": 54,
      "text": "死故當時莫知所出及薨帝常思見之遂為通"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R04",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 72,
      "text": "替棺欲見輒引替視屍如此積日形色不異追"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R05",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 90,
      "text": "贈貴妃謚曰宣及葬給轀輬車虎賁班劎鑾輅"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R06",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 90,
      "end": 108,
      "text": "九旒黃屋左纛前後部羽葆鼓吹上自於南掖"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R07",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 108,
      "end": 126,
      "text": "門臨過喪車悲不自勝左右莫不掩泣上痛愛"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R08",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 8,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 144,
      "text": "不已精神罔罔頗廢政事每寢先於靈牀酌奠"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13R09",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 9,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 144,
      "end": 162,
      "text": "酒飲之既而慟哭不能自反又諷有司奏曰據"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L01",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 1,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 162,
      "end": 180,
      "text": "春秋仲子非魯惠公元嫡尚得考別宮今貴妃"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L02",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 2,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 180,
      "end": 198,
      "text": "蓋天秩之崇班理應創新乃立別廟于都下時"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L03",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 198,
      "end": 216,
      "text": "有巫者能見鬼説帝言貴妃可致帝大喜令召"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L04",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 216,
      "end": 234,
      "text": "之有少頃果於帷中見形如平生帝欲與之言"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L05",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 234,
      "end": 252,
      "text": "默然不對將執手奄然便歇帝尤哽恨於是擬"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L06",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 252,
      "end": 270,
      "text": "李夫人賦以寄意焉謝莊作哀策文奏之帝臥"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L07",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 270,
      "end": 288,
      "text": "覽讀起坐流涕曰不謂當今復有此才都下傳"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L08",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 8,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 288,
      "end": 306,
      "text": "寫紙墨為之貴或云貴妃是殷琰家人入義宣"
    },
    {
      "locator": "13L09",
      "pdf_page": 13,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 9,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=13",
      "start": 306,
      "end": 313,
      "text": "家義宣敗入宮云"
    }
  ],
